2. ALGORITHMS & METHODOLOGIES
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  The following proprietary algorithms are exclusively owned:

  a) Multi-Source Battery Capacity Estimation
     - Sysfs reader with dual-cell detection
     - Charge counter based calculation
     - Voltage curve interpolation
     - Multi-source weighted averaging with confidence scoring

  b) Hybrid Voltage Monitoring System
     - Direct voltage derivative analysis
     - Synthetic voltage calculation from multi-sensor fusion
     - Automatic source selection (DIRECT → BLENDED → SYNTHETIC)
     - PMIC stall detection

  c) Adaptive Stress Testing Framework
     - Quick benchmark-based device profiling
     - Dynamic iteration calculation based on device tier
     - Battery stress test with internal resistance measurement
     - Storage type detection (UFS/eMMC) via performance profiling

  d) Device Age Forensic Estimation
     - 5-vector age determination (sysfs, system properties,
       OEM serial decoding, vendor partition, Build.TIME)
     - Samsung serial number year/month extraction
     - Weighted confidence scoring from multiple sources

  e) Scan Quality Scoring System
     - 10-dimension quality evaluation
     - Data contamination detection
     - Voltage glitch analysis
     - Automated quality classification (EXCELLENT to INVALID)

